From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WavJaby <WavJaby@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:00:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Build libaaudio for x86_64 guests

The identity engine runs x86_64 guests on an x86_64 host, so the
NativeBridge guest needs an x86_64 build of the libaaudio proxy
(Unity FMOD dlopens it). Its stub list is LP64 and arch-neutral
(stubs_arm64.cc equals stubs_riscv64.cc), so the x86_64 build takes
the arm64 list, as 0004, 0005, 0007 and 0008 do.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Patch-Reason: the x86_64 arch block lives inside this Android.bp module, which no launcher, loader or environment setting can add; the stub list is shared by every LP64 arch here
---
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 android_api/libaaudio/Android.bp | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/android_api/libaaudio/Android.bp b/android_api/libaaudio/Android.bp
index 6d0d87cf09a006a487b258a2a19d92861224b5dd..84313aca8be002123f79bf39423eab0867c49bf2 100644
--- a/android_api/libaaudio/Android.bp
+++ b/android_api/libaaudio/Android.bp
@@ -30,6 +30,9 @@ cc_library {
         arm64: {
             srcs: ["stubs_arm64.cc"],
         },
+        x86_64: {
+            srcs: ["stubs_arm64.cc"],
+        },
         riscv64: {
             srcs: ["stubs_riscv64.cc"],
         },
